//? Title: Deep Boltzmann Machines: Exact Marginals and Mean Field
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
Native tensor graphs expose the deep boltzmann experiment, with explicit inputs, derivatives and reproducible source fixtures. The complete editable program preserves the bounded source protocol and its checks.
)
