> Check the all-zero exact partition

Zero couplings and biases give2^15 equally weighted joint states. The visible marginal is uniform over256 states, and clamped mean field is exact because every hidden unit is independent.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/deep_boltzmann_worked.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){namespace n=dm::nn;namespace m=n::models;std::filesystem::create_directories("build");n::ParameterStore p(1);m::DeepBoltzmannParameters(p);for(auto& key:p.names())p.set(key,n::zeros_like(p.at(key)));auto exact=m::DbmUnnormalized(p,m::BinaryStates(8));auto z=m::LogSumExp(exact.log_weight,0);auto values=n::stack({z,n::mean(z-exact.log_weight),n::mean(m::DbmMeanField(p,n::zeros({1,8})).free_energy)+z},0);if(std::abs(values.to_vector<float>()[1]-8*std::log(2.))>1e-6)return 1;
std::print("| coordinate | computed value |\n|---:|---:|\n");auto v=values.to_vector<double>();for(size_t i=0;i<v.size();++i)std::print("| {} | {:.9f} |\n",i,v[i]);n::save_npz("build/deep_boltzmann_worked.npz",{{"values",values}});dm::graphics::RPlot::create().bars(n::arange(0,std::int64_t(v.size())).to_vector<double>(),v,"native values",{37,99,235}).title("Check the all-zero exact partition").size(1000,550).save_svg("build/deep_boltzmann_worked.svg");}
```
